                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        “Our annual tech conference required seamless banquet service for 800 international delegates. CateringFlow's team executed without a hitch.”
